{
 "id": "conversation_elaborate",
 "version": "1.1.0",
 "depends_on": [
  "conversation_topic_tracking"
 ],
 "description": "Graph-native progressive DISCLOSURE ('tell me more'). After the agent answers about a topic X (a 1-3 sentence summary) and X is recorded as the conversation's current topic (agent -current_topic-> CurrentTopic{name:X}), a continuation follow-up ('tell me more', 'elaborate', 'go on') serves the NEXT unseen chunk of detail each time -- the DECISION and the progression live HERE, in graph rules, not Python. No arithmetic: a served-marker chain (mirrors the Not/Exists precedents of gap_awareness / topic_route). THREE rules + held cue Concepts:\n\n  (1) request_detail_for_current_topic -- the DECISION 'prefetch the detail for the topic we are discussing': when agent -current_topic-> ct exists and no DetailRequest for that topic exists yet, mint DetailRequest{topic:<ct.name>, status:'requested'}. A mechanical dispatch (domains.fetch_dispatch.scan_and_ingest_detail, mirroring scan_and_search) fulfils each requested DetailRequest -- calling domains.topic_grounding.topic_detail(agent, topic) and ingesting the returned ordered chunk list as a graph CHAIN (Topic{name} -detail_head-> c0; Topic -has_detail-> each c; c -next_detail-> c_next). Guard: mint once per topic.\n\n  (2) serve_next_detail_chunk -- the SERVE decision. Match agent -received-> m JOINed to agent -current_topic-> ct JOINed to a Topic t -has_detail-> c. Where: NOT comprehended(m); a has_mention of m resolves (intent seed's Mention -refers_to-> Concept name match) to a continuation-cue Concept (more/elaborate/continue/further/else/expand); t.name == ct.name; c.served != 1.0; and c is the HEAD OF THE UNSERVED RUN -- either c has no predecessor (InNeighbours(c,next_detail) empty) OR its predecessor is served (an InNeighbour p over next_detail with p.served==1.0). Effects: mint reply Message{from:agent, text:<Attr c text>} + responds_to m + agent -sent-> reply; set c.served=1.0; set m.comprehended=1.0. Serves exactly ONE next chunk per 'more', in order, no arithmetic.\n\n  (3) elaboration_exhausted -- honest floor. When a continuation cue + current_topic and detail chunks EXIST for the topic but NONE are unserved, mint an honest reply ('That is the main of what I hold about it.') + comprehended, so 'more' is never silent. (When NO detail chunks exist for the topic at all, this rule does NOT fire and the summary re-answer path in conversation_topic_tracking handles the turn unchanged -- the anaphor-exclusion guard there defers to this seed ONLY when detail chunks are present.)\n\nSingle-anchor matches on agent -received-> m (the sd 'agent observed obs' pattern, never ['agent','is_a','Agent'] which over-fires); comprehended=1.0 is the mint-once fixpoint guard. The adapter renders the minted reply via _graph_reply_for (mechanical read-back) -- no decision in Python.",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "local_id": 1,
   "type": "Concept",
   "attrs": {
    "name": "more",
    "description": "continuation cue: serve more detail on the current topic"
   }
  },
  {
   "local_id": 2,
   "type": "Concept",
   "attrs": {
    "name": "elaborate",
    "description": "continuation cue: elaborate further on the current topic"
   }
  },
  {
   "local_id": 3,
   "type": "Concept",
   "attrs": {
    "name": "continue",
    "description": "continuation cue: continue disclosing detail on the current topic"
   }
  },
  {
   "local_id": 4,
   "type": "Concept",
   "attrs": {
    "name": "further",
    "description": "continuation cue: go further into the current topic"
   }
  },
  {
   "local_id": 5,
   "type": "Concept",
   "attrs": {
    "name": "else",
    "description": "continuation cue: what else is there about the current topic"
   }
  },
  {
   "local_id": 6,
   "type": "Concept",
   "attrs": {
    "name": "expand",
    "description": "continuation cue: expand on the current topic"
   }
  }
 ],
 "edges": [],
 "productions": [],
 "rules": [
  {
   "name": "request_detail_for_current_topic",
   "match": [
    [
     "agent",
     "current_topic",
     "ct"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "Not",
    "arg": {
     "type": "Exists",
     "source": {
      "type": "NodesOfType",
      "node_type": "DetailRequest"
     },
     "var_name": "dr",
     "predicate": {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "dr"
       },
       "key": "topic"
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "ct"
       },
       "key": "name"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "add_node",
     "req",
     "DetailRequest",
     {
      "status": "requested",
      "topic": {
       "__term__": {
        "type": "Attr",
        "node": {
         "type": "Var",
         "name": "ct"
        },
        "key": "name"
       }
      }
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "serve_next_detail_chunk",
   "match": [
    [
     "agent",
     "received",
     "m"
    ],
    [
